{#- How many lines wait for the person signed in, followed live from anywhere
    on the page: nothing drawn here, the count shown is the one a tool of
    the dock hangs on its icon (`tool`, its name — tool_dock(), `count`,
    first given `conversation_unread_count()`). Heard on the person's own
    topic (`user`, their id), where the application opens its accounts to
    live subscription. -#}
<span {{ component_render_tag_attributes({ class: 'conversation-unread' }) }}
      data-user="{{ user }}"
      data-tool="{{ tool }}"
      hidden></span>
